# gz zooms in and gu zooms out, like . and >, and Alt+l and Alt+h do neither.
file <<END
Work:
	Launch:
		- Draft announcement
Home
END
keys gz
see › Work
keys <A-l>
see › Work
hide › Launch
keys gz
see › Work › Launch
keys gu
see ▌   Launch:
hide › Launch
keys <A-h>
see › Work
keys gu
see Home
hide › Work
quit
